#: kamu/forms/identity.py:514
msgid ""
"Cannot allow authentication with single contact at this high assurance level."
msgstr ""
"Kan inte tillåta autentisering med en enda kontakt på denna höga tillitsnivå."

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:27 kamu/forms/membership.py:140
#: kamu/forms/membership.py:250
msgid "Notify approvers"
msgstr "Meddela godkännare"

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:30 kamu/forms/membership.py:252
msgid ""
"Send notification to the role notification address about the new invite "
"requiring approval."
msgstr ""
"Skicka en avisering till rollens aviseringsadress om den nya inbjudan som "
"kräver godkännande."

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:43
msgid "Add member"
msgstr "Lägg till medlem"

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:84
msgid "Update membership"
msgstr "Uppdatera medlemskap"

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:102 kamu/forms/membership.py:196
msgid "Verification phone number is required for this role."
msgstr "Verifieringsnummer krävs för denna roll."

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:130
msgid "Send an email to the invitee right away"
msgstr "Skicka ett e-postmeddelande till den inbjudna personen omedelbart"

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:133
msgid ""
"The invited person can accept the invitation in Kamu even before approval. "
"However, membership and services—such as the ability to create a username—"
"will not be available until after approval. By default, Kamu sends an email "
"to the invited person only after approval."
msgstr ""
"Den inbjudna personen kan acceptera inbjudan i Kamu redan innan "
"godkännandet. Medlemskapet och tjänsterna, t.ex. möjligheten att skapa ett "
"användarkonto, fungerar dock först efter godkännandet. Som standard skickas "
"ett e-postmeddelande från Kamu till den inbjudna personen först efter "
"godkännandet."

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:143
msgid ""
"Approvers can accept the invitation as soon as you send it, but you can "
"choose to send them an email to speed up the process. By default, no email "
"is sent."
msgstr ""
"De som ska godkänna inbjudan kan göra det direkt när du har skickat den, men "
"du kan om du vill skicka ett e-postmeddelande till dem för att påskynda "
"processen. Som standard skickas inget e-postmeddelande."

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:167 kamu/forms/membership.py:269
msgid "Invite"
msgstr "Inbjudan"

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:168 kamu/forms/membership.py:270
#: kamu/templates/membership/membership_invite.html:58
msgid "Preview message"
msgstr "Förhandsgranska meddelande"

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:221
msgid ""
"This email address already has an invite to the role during this time period."
msgstr ""
"Den här e-postadressen har redan en inbjudan till rollen under den här "
"tidsperioden."

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:230
msgid "Invited persons"
msgstr "Inbjudna personer"

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:233
msgid ""
"Invited persons, one per line. Each line should contain given name, surname, "
"email address, followed by optional phone number and/or Finnish personal "
"identity code, values separated by comma. Phone number must be in "
"international format. Example: \"Test,Person,person@example.org,"
"+358501234567,010181-900C\""
msgstr ""
"Inbjudna personer, en per rad. Varje rad ska innehålla förnamn, efternamn, e-"
"postadress, och valfritt telefonnummer och/eller personbeteckning, "
"separerade med komma. Telefonnumret ska vara i internationellt format. Till "
"exempel: \"Test,Person,person@example.org,+358501234567,010181-900C\""

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:240
msgid "Send invite email before approval"
msgstr "Skicka inbjudningsmejl före godkännande"

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:243
msgid ""
"Send the invitation email before approval. The invited person can accept "
"immediately, but the membership and its permissions, including the ability "
"to create a user account, will only become active after approval. If not "
"selected, the invitation email will be sent after approval."
msgstr ""
"Skicka inbjudningsmejl före godkännande. Den inbjudna personen kan acceptera "
"direkt, men medlemskapet och dess behörigheter, inklusive möjligheten att "
"skapa ett användarkonto, blir aktiva först efter godkännande. Om inte valt "
"skickas inbjudningsmejlet efter godkännandet."

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:305
msgid "No invited persons."
msgstr "Inga inbjudna personer."

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:308
msgid "Too many invited persons."
msgstr "För många inbjudna personer."

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:321
#, python-format
msgid "Invalid value: \"%(part)s\"."
msgstr "Ogiltigt värde: \"%(part)s\"."

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:324
#, python-format
msgid "Invalid line: \"%(line)s\"."
msgstr "Ogiltig rad: \"%(line)s\"."

#: kamu/forms/membership.py:327
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Line is missing identifiers: \"%(line)s\". First two fields are for names."
msgstr ""
"Raden saknar identifierare: \"%(line)s\". De två första fälten är för namn."

