"If you did not make this change, update your email address back in Kamu and "
"contact the IT Helpdesk."
msgstr ""
"Om du inte gjorde denna ändring, uppdatera din e‑postadress tillbaka i Kamu\n"
"och kontakta IT-helpdesk."

